      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This suggestion seems real pointless to me.\nIt takes less than a total of a minute to change to stricter safety settings during the event and back to your usual settings when it's over.\nWhy would you have to constantly mess with your safety settings during the event?",
      "viewerReactions": null
