      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I feel like this could change avatar culture for the better and encourage users to create and use more optimised avatars or risk not being able to join in without turning into a robot by default for everyone in that room. \nHaving your own safety settings is fine but because it's so individualised, people don't take notice or care what your settings may be. Instead this would set a requirement for communities as a whole and hopefully get more people on the optimisation train.\n+1 from me.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
