      "value": "@{58c6b8ad227a56787575ebbd|full_name}: Because people may have a lot of their friends showing already so they'd have to either reset it for everyone or go through individuals to show them. Also you're kind of missing the point. People could join the instance knowing they there is an override already applied and not have to worry about changing their safety or lagging while they change such settings. This makes it way more seamless. Encouraging more optimised avatars as people will start making instances like this. Also lets people know that their bad performing avatar is not welcome. By default everyone is safe from crashers more. \nIt makes things way more seamless and simple. \nI'm not saying make it available for public instances although it would be neat to be able to make your own public instance with these settings. Only suggesting it for the other types.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
