      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "For those worried about being in instances with such rules I may also suggest VRChat to add an option in the safety settings to allow world safety overwrites. This means if you do not wish to go through everyone which is hidden because of the world rules you can just disable this settings and be back on your own safety settings.",
