      "value": "@{58c6b8ad227a56787575ebbd|full_name}: I think some people are getting confused. I'm not saying this straight up can't use them. I'm saying if someone creates the instance and decides to hide avatars of a certain level then they will just be hidden by default for everyone unless they decide to show them or they change avatar. Also I am not talking about public instances. All this is doing is allowing the person the rightful tools to control their own instance/events.",
